  <Row><Cell>merc_test_bark_string</Cell><Cell>This is a test. I like cheese.</Cell><Cell>This is a test. I like cheese.</Cell></Row>
  
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story1</Cell><Cell>I don't fear death, I fear soup made by someone confident.</Cell><Cell>I don't fear death, I fear soup made by someone confident.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story2</Cell><Cell>I once trusted a man who said shortcut, we arrived older.</Cell><Cell>I once trusted a man who said shortcut, we arrived older.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story3</Cell><Cell>A priest, a butcher and a taxman walk into a tavern - everyone hides their groschen.</Cell><Cell>A priest, a butcher and a taxman walk into a tavern - everyone hides their groschen.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story4</Cell><Cell>He said he knew the road, the road is agreed.</Cell><Cell>He said he knew the road, the road is agreed.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story5</Cell><Cell>My uncle survived three wars and died arguing with a goose.</Cell><Cell>My uncle survived three wars and died arguing with a goose.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story6</Cell><Cell>A rich man calls it patience, a poor man calls it waiting.</Cell><Cell>A rich man calls it patience, a poor man calls it waiting.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story7</Cell><Cell>Nothing humbles a man faster, than trying to look brave while slipping in mud.</Cell><Cell>Nothing humbles a man faster, than trying to look brave while slipping in mud.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story8</Cell><Cell>I don't drink to forget, I drink because the water ... looks ambitious.</Cell><Cell>I don't drink to forget, I drink because the water ... looks ambitious.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story9</Cell><Cell>I prayed for guidance and got rain. Well, close enough.</Cell><Cell>I prayed for guidance and got rain. Well, close enough.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story10</Cell><Cell>A man who says trust me, has already stolen something.</Cell><Cell>A man who says trust me, has already stolen something.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story11</Cell><Cell>The woods are peaceful, until you remember, everything in them eats without a spoon.</Cell><Cell>The woods are peaceful, until you remember, everything in them eats without a spoon.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story12</Cell><Cell>I would rather sleep in a ditch, than in a castle with politics.</Cell><Cell>I would rather sleep in a ditch, than in a castle with politics.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story13</Cell><Cell>Never insult a cook before breakfast, that's how legends become warnings.</Cell><Cell>Never insult a cook before breakfast, that's how legends become warnings.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story14</Cell><Cell>Henry went to deliver a message and invented six unrelated crimes on the way.</Cell><Cell>Henry went to deliver a message and invented six unrelated crimes on the way.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story15</Cell><Cell>I saw a man walk into the Kuttenberg mines sober, that was his first mistake.</Cell><Cell>I saw a man walk into the Kuttenberg mines sober, that was his first mistake.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story16</Cell><Cell>Kuttenberg has fine walls, shame about the people inside them.</Cell><Cell>Kuttenberg has fine walls, shame about the people inside them.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story17</Cell><Cell>Henry of Skalitz, blacksmith, messenger, detective, idiot magnet.</Cell><Cell>Henry of Skalitz, blacksmith, messenger, detective, idiot magnet.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story18</Cell><Cell>I met a peaceful monk once, he was sharpening something.</Cell><Cell>I met a peaceful monk once, he was sharpening something.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story19</Cell><Cell>A man with clean armor near Kuttenberg is either rich or recently replaced.</Cell><Cell>A man with clean armor near Kuttenberg is either rich or recently replaced.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story20</Cell><Cell>He said it was a simple job, was henry's speech for bring armor and a priest.</Cell><Cell>He said it was a simple job, was henry's speech for bring armor and a priest.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story21</Cell><Cell>I have guarded caravans safer, than one of henry's polite conversations.</Cell><Cell>I have guarded caravans safer, than one of henry's polite conversations.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>a614a_story22</Cell><Cell>Henry, you have the rare gift of making armed men look like paperwork.</Cell><Cell>Henry, you have the rare gift of making armed men look like paperwork.</Cell></Row>
  
  
  


